pretend doing that for the core language. I bet that going in that=20
direction will end up with "Ok, great job, but we don't want to integrate=
=20
it because X, Y or Z".

I'm currently trying to think about & prepare proposals to improve=20
organizations. I'll tell you all soon, so that we can debate. Please share=
=20
your thoughts!

la .sykyndyr.


